ow, which then crash-lands in one of the Zones. When the girls arrive at the site, they discover that a company named YELLOW CAKE is responsible for dumping high-level waste into the Old Capital.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ha4tpS1s883PBb4N07GG70u4SOu.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"7933","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"9479","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"9479","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"60659","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"272132","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"88871","synopsis":"While heading to their next destination, the girls encounter a father and his pregnant daughter being attacked by a group of armed men.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xaSMWl10fl9tlLpY4sZMTEDX0oD.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"7933","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"9479","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"9479","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"60659","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"272132","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"88872","synopsis":"Aoi’s careless action results in her being captured by the 1st Division. Realizing that the enemy is actually after the Coppelion and not the survivors, Ibara tries to rescue Aoi, only to be knocked unconscious by one of the men.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/h1FNoefp40dLBfTKuaeHXrKtubi.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"7933","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"9479","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider"